# 基本図形編集に文字を運んで離す (design 11.3, 10.4) のを、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの
# 図形編集で同じにする, for tools/ui_run.py: a figure of 30 small rectangles, two zigzag lines
# and one piece of text "ABC" (mkbig fig 30 4 1) opened at 100,100 as 画用紙 is, the piece's
# box from 210,247 to 330,287 on the screen. A document of two lines (青木 遥, 〒), made here
# and opened as 運ぶ元 with no object behind it, is moved by its name band to 560,360, out of
# the way of the piece. Its first line, picked from Home to Shift+End, is carried onto the
# figure where nothing is (300,520): a new piece of text stands there. The document is brought
# in front again by its band where the figure does not cover it, its second line picked and
# carried onto the piece "ABC": the letters go into it. The letters leave the document as they
# go into the desktop's figure, so the process is given a second document of the same lines. The figure saved, record 0 comes out
# the same, byte for byte, whichever of the two took the letters.
# Keys: Home 4A, End 4D (with Shift 02); Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 30 4 1
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>青木 遥</p>
xml <p>〒</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 運ぶ元
wait 500
drag 300 75 760 375
wait 500
win 運ぶ元
shot drop_start
# the first line onto the figure where nothing is
click 600 400
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
hold 575 400
wait 100
move 560 420
wait 100
move 420 480
wait 100
move 300 520
wait 300
up
expect figure: text dropped as a new piece (0)
sync 600
wait 300
# the document brought back by its band, the second line onto the piece
click 980 375
wait 300
front dk 運ぶ元
expect ok dk: in front
click 575 435
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
hold 577 435
wait 100
move 560 435
wait 100
move 400 360
wait 100
move 250 262
wait 300
up
expect figure: text dropped into a piece (0)
sync 600
wait 300
shot drop_kernel
win 画用紙
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
# the same with the figure editor running as a process, from a document of the same two
# lines opened again where the first was: the letters left the first one as they went into
# the desktop's figure
mkbig fig 30 4 1
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 33
wait 500
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document><text lang="0" bpat="0"/>
xml <p>青木 遥</p>
xml <p>〒</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlopen 運ぶ元２
wait 500
drag 550 75 1010 375
wait 500
win 運ぶ元２
click 980 375
wait 300
front dp 運ぶ元２
expect ok dp: in front
click 600 400
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
logmark
hold 575 400
wait 100
move 560 420
wait 100
move 420 480
wait 100
move 300 520
wait 300
up
expectsince figure: text dropped as a new piece (0)
wait 600
click 980 375
wait 300
front dp2 運ぶ元２
expect ok dp2: in front
click 575 435
key 4A
key 4D 02
wait 200
logmark
hold 577 435
wait 100
move 560 435
wait 100
move 400 360
wait 100
move 250 262
wait 300
up
expectsince figure: text dropped into a piece (0)
wait 600
shot drop_process
win 画用紙
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
